{"obsah":"<p>We received an invitation from Čepřovice near Strakonice, where a ball of 6 municipalities was being held. Nothing was left to chance – the organiser booked us back in January, so we were free and the team of Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček and Lukáš Valný could head to the event. Besides the mayor, we also had kids on hand, who gave us great support. The atmosphere was lively, as is usual at village balls, and from among the sportsmen and sportswomen we chose a few volunteers who weren't afraid to lie down under our bikes. Thanks for the invitation – hopefully see you at an exhibition or workshop next year.</p>\n\n<p>Sorry for the lower photo quality – we only managed to get a video, from which they were created.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2024-12-11-v-9.11.38.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2024-12-11-v-9.11.38.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250270\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2024-12-11-v-9.12.01.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2024-12-11-v-9.12.01.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250269\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F12%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2024-12-11-v-9.12.09.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.goo